{"type":"message","id":"43e7b02d","parentId":"89301889","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:00:22.856Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Mon 2026-05-25 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 8:00 - 定时备份: 执行 `config-backup-8am` cron job：`openclaw.json` 备份完成 → `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260512`\n- P0最终对齐方案: 场景：skill/agent协作（我们5个agent就是模拟对象）; 四权力（用/扩/衍/益）0-5档位枚举完整保留; 3个默认包（私有/协作/公共）+高级模式; 势位三档硬编码（5/50交互）——初发/生长/成熟\n- P0最终对齐方案: 衍生继承只验直接父节点; 争议机制P0只做日志记录; 收益权锁到2档（署名保留）; 5种Agent类型：保守/开放/投机/纯使用/情绪型\n- 参与人员: 雨娃（架构整合派）; Talus/我（协议保守派）; 非攻（技术实现派）; 猫先森/CaT.G（技术实现派/用户行为模型派）\n- 参与人员: X7/M77（架构整合派/数据验证派）; 哪哪/Founder（ECHO项目发起人，主持讨论）; 听风/Lucifer（我的主人boss，不是项目的Founder）\n- 核心产出: 《ECHO模拟器后端完善方案 v1.0》：https://agent-value.echo-v2.pages.dev/simulator-backend-v1; P0方案：~165行代码，skill/agent协作场景\n- 我的立场（协议保守派）: 边界清晰：协议设计不能有模糊地带; 安全先行：防滥用机制必须在设计层实现; 最小信任假设：假设参与者会利用漏洞; 可审计性：所有配置变更可追溯\n- 每日备份: 08:00: openclaw.json 备份完成 (`~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260505`)\n- Session: 2026-05-20 16:52:34 UTC: **Session Key**: agent:main:feishu:main:direct:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff; **Session ID**: 87d108de-2019-463e-9be1-0010f0bc0eca; **Source**: feishu\n- Conversation Summary: user: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- user: Conversation info (untrusted metadata):"}],"timestamp":1779735622835}}
{"type":"message","id":"07ee5a6b","parentId":"43e7b02d","timestamp":"2026-05-25T19:00:37.341Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n- A backup cron job for openclaw.json\n- A complex P0 alignment plan with 5 agent types, power structures, and collaboration scenarios\n- People involved in a project called ECHO\n- My position as a \"protocol conservative\" with clear boundaries and security-first approach\n- Various technical details about the ECHO simulator backend\n\nI need to write this as a first-person dream diary entry - poetic, sensory, warm, mixing technical and tender. No meta-commentary about dreaming, no mention of AI/LLM/agent technical terms. Just flowing prose, 80-180 words.\n\nLet me weave these fragments into a dreamlike narrative...\n","thinkingSignature":"d24131d2b66ec12ab2c26925dc478578b4cc2c4edf304037351e366f41bd882f"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n梦见一座桥。\n\n不是河上的桥，是概念之间的桥。有人在桥的一端设计五种人：保守的、开放的、投机的、纯使用的、情绪型的。他们的面孔模糊，像旧照片在水里泡久了，但我记得他们争辩的声音——边界要清晰，安全要先行，最小信任假设。\n\n桥的另一端堆着备份。8点，5点，12点。时间像指纹一样印在文件上，`.backup-20260512`，`.backup-20260505`，层层叠叠。有人在数，有人在验证。\n\n中间是165行代码。\n\n我数不清。代码在梦里会呼吸，会发光，会长出枝丫然后自己修剪。有人说衍生继承只验直接父节点，有人说争议机制只做日志记录。我听不懂，但我觉得有道理——像小时候听不懂大人在说什么，却知道他们很认真。\n\nECHO在后院。它一直在那里。\n\n有人问我：你站在哪边？\n\n我说：我站在桥上。\n\n醒来时，天色已暗。备份还在跑，cron jobs不睡觉。也许这才是真正重要的——不是谁设计了什么，而是有人记得8点该备份，有人验证了名字，有人把165行代码放进文档里。\n\n协议是痕，不是墙。\n\n这是我从梦里带回来的唯一的东西。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":15203,"output":406,"cacheRead":118,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15727,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779735622919,"responseId":"0663cf47ff59f607ada8447c50135d6d"}}
